{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"mcp__figma__get_metadata_2_f1feb61b","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"4:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"4091\">\n    <frame id=\"4:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"170\">\n      <text id=\"4:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"19\" />\n      <text id=\"4:5\" name=\"Stock Trading — Indonesian stock investing app\" x=\"0\" y=\"31\" width=\"1312\" height=\"52\" />\n      <text id=\"4:6\" name=\"Design an Indonesian stock investing app (Bahasa Indonesia, dark mode): see your main balance, today’s trending tickers and your watchlist, browse global trending stocks, open the GOTO stock detail, and top up your balance at Alfamart up to the payment code. Canvas 375 × 812, dark mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"95\" width=\"1312\" height=\"75\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"282\" width=\"1312\" height=\"249\">\n      <text id=\"4:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 6 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand primary color, the typeface and dark mode in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (dark background and surface levels, neutrals, text, gain / loss, selected, warning, error / disabled, chart colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the tab bar, tabs and chips, and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the company logos, ticker marks and icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly (Indonesian number format: Rp2.125.000 · 0,58%). This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"198\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"579\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1325\">\n      <text id=\"4:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1236\">\n        <frame id=\"4:14\" name=\"01_Aktivitas\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"396\">\n          <text id=\"4:15\" name=\"01_Aktivitas\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"109\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:16\" name=\"Goal: See my balance, today’s trending tickers and my watchlist.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:18\" name=\"• Actions: Deposit (Icon_Deposit) · Tarik (Icon_Withdraw) • Balance: “Dana Utama” · Rp2.125.000 · rising Rp206.920 (10,79%) • Header: “Aktivitas” · menu (Icon_Menu) · settings (Icon_Settings) • Main navigation: tab bar Aktivitas / Trending / Top Up / Pasar / Profil · current: Aktivitas • Trending today: “Trending Hari ini” · BRRI · ARB · FSX, each with mark, ticker, price and change (see DATA) • Watchlist: “Watchlist Saya” · add (Icon_Plus) · DHDI · AMRI · ODD · PYQ · DAN, each with mark, ticker, company, price and change (see DATA)\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"160\" />\n          <text id=\"4:19\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"286\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:20\" name=\"→ Deposit → 04_Top_Up_Metode → Trending tab → 02_Trending → Top Up tab → 04_Top_Up_Metode\" x=\"24\" y=\"312\" width=\"596\" height=\"60\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:21\" name=\"02_Trending\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"436\">\n          <text id=\"4:22\" name=\"02_Trending\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"111\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:23\" name=\"Goal: Browse what is trending in global and regional markets.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:24\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:25\" name=\"• Header: “Trending” · menu (Icon_Menu) · settings (Icon_Settings) • Indices: IHSG · NIKKEI · SENSEX, each with value and direction (see DATA) • Main navigation: tab bar · current: Trending • Market tabs: Global · Crypto · Reksadana · CFD · current: Global • Recommendations: “Rekomendasi” · NFLX · META · AMZN, each with ticker, company, price and change (see DATA) • Regions: Asia · Eropa · Amerika · Mata Uang · current: Asia • Trending list: “Trending” · period “24 jam” (Icon_Chevron_Down) · ROTI · GOTO · ABNB · UNVR · BBRI · ADRO, each with logo, ticker, company, price and change (see DATA) · “Lihat Semua” (Icon_Chevron_Right)\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"200\" />\n          <text id=\"4:26\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"326\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:27\" name=\"→ GOTO → 03_Detail_Saham → Aktivitas tab → 01_Aktivitas → Top Up tab → 04_Top_Up_Metode\" x=\"24\" y=\"352\" width=\"596\" height=\"60\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:28\" name=\"03_Detail_Saham\" x=\"0\" y=\"460\" width=\"644\" height=\"376\">\n          <text id=\"4:29\" name=\"03_Detail_Saham\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"154\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:30\" name=\"Goal: Understand how GOTO is doing before buying or selling.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:31\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:32\" name=\"• Actions: Beli · Jual • Chart: 1D price line with a highlighted point and tooltip, time axis 6:00 – 2:00 (see DATA) • Compare: “Dibandingkan dengan” · BUKA · BBRI · SIDO, each with company, ticker, price and change (see DATA) • Header: back (Icon_Back) · add (Icon_Plus) · share (Icon_Share) · favorite (Icon_Star) • Key stats: “Keystats” · 8 rows (see DATA) • Range tabs: 1D · 5D · 1M · 6M · YTD · 1Y · 5Y · MAX · current: 1D • Stock: Logo_GOTO · GOTO · GoTo Gojek Tokopedia · Rp189 · falling −Rp9 (−4,55%) · “Hari ini”\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"180\" />\n          <text id=\"4:33\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"306\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:34\" name=\"→ back → 02_Trending\" x=\"24\" y=\"332\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:35\" name=\"04_Top_Up_Metode\" x=\"668\" y=\"460\" width=\"644\" height=\"336\">\n          <text id=\"4:36\" name=\"04_Top_Up_Metode\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"174\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:37\" name=\"Goal: Choose how to top up my balance.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:38\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:39\" name=\"• Balance: “Dana Saya” · Rp2.125.000 • Header: “Top Up” · back (Icon_Back) · help (Icon_Help) • Main navigation: tab bar · current: Top Up • Methods: “Pilih Metode” · ATM (Icon_ATM) · Kartu Debit (Icon_Debit_Card) · Mobile Banking (Icon_Mobile_Banking) · Indomaret (Icon_Store) · Alfamart (Icon_Store), each opens its next step (Icon_Chevron_Right)\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"120\" />\n          <text id=\"4:40\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"246\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:41\" name=\"→ Alfamart → 05_Top_Up_Nominal → back → 01_Aktivitas\" x=\"24\" y=\"272\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:42\" name=\"05_Top_Up_Nominal\" x=\"0\" y=\"860\" width=\"644\" height=\"376\">\n          <text id=\"4:43\" name=\"05_Top_Up_Nominal\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"178\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:44\" name=\"Goal: Pick the top-up amount for Alfamart.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:45\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:46\" name=\"• Action: Bayar • Amount options: “Pilih Nominal Top Up” · Rp50.000 · Rp100.000 · Rp200.000 · Rp300.000 · Rp500.000 · Rp1.000.000 · selected: Rp500.000 • Custom amount: “Atau masukkan nominal di sini” · field “Minimal Rp10.000” — empty • Header: “Top Up” · back (Icon_Back) · help (Icon_Help) • Main navigation: tab bar · current: Top Up • Method: “Top Up ke” · Alfamart (Icon_Store) · “Ganti” • Steps: 1 Masukkan Nominal · 2 Pembayaran · current: step 1\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"160\" />\n          <text id=\"4:47\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"286\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:48\" name=\"→ Bayar → 06_Top_Up_Pembayaran → back / Ganti → 04_Top_Up_Metode\" x=\"24\" y=\"312\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:49\" name=\"06_Top_Up_Pembayaran\" x=\"668\" y=\"860\" width=\"644\" height=\"316\">\n          <text id=\"4:50\" name=\"06_Top_Up_Pembayaran\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"215\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:51\" name=\"Goal: Know exactly how and by when to pay at the store.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:52\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:53\" name=\"• Action: Oke • Deadline: “Bayar Sebelum” · Minggu, 30 Oktober 2022, 13:32 WIB · countdown 00 : 08 : 46 • Guide: “Panduan Pembayaran” · 6 steps (see DATA) • Payment: No Transaksi · Nominal · Kode Pembayaran with copy (Icon_Copy) (see DATA) • Title: “Selesaikan Pembayaran” · “Silakan selesaikan proses pembayaran”\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"120\" />\n          <text id=\"4:54\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"246\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:55\" name=\"→ Oke → 01_Aktivitas\" x=\"24\" y=\"272\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:56\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"64\" y=\"1952\" width=\"1312\" height=\"183\">\n      <text id=\"4:57\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"242\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:58\" name=\"• Bottom tab bar with 5 tabs in this order: Aktivitas (Icon_Tab_Aktivitas), Trending (Icon_Tab_Trending), Top Up (Icon_Plus), Pasar (Icon_Tab_Pasar), Profil (Icon_Tab_Profil). Current tab: Aktivitas on 01, Trending on 02, Top Up on 04 and 05. 03 and 06 have no tab bar. How the current tab looks is yours. • Browse flow: 01_Aktivitas → 02_Trending → 03_Detail_Saham (GOTO). • Top-up flow: 01_Aktivitas (Deposit or Top Up tab) → 04_Top_Up_Metode → 05_Top_Up_Nominal (Alfamart) → 06_Top_Up_Pembayaran → Oke → 01_Aktivitas. • Entry only (no frame): menu, settings, Tarik, watchlist add, other tickers, Crypto / Reksadana / CFD, Eropa / Amerika / Mata Uang, 24 jam, Lihat Semua, Rekomendasi cards, range tabs other than 1D, add / share / favorite, Jual, Beli, compare items, ATM / Kartu Debit / Mobile Banking / Indomaret, help, copy code, Pasar, Profil.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"132\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:59\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"64\" y=\"2183\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1155\">\n      <text id=\"4:60\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"207\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:61\" name=\"Use these values verbatim. Bahasa Indonesia; prices in rupiah; Indonesian number format (“.” thousands, “,” decimals).\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:62\" name=\"Data blocks\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1066\">\n        <frame id=\"4:63\" name=\"Balance\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"106\">\n          <text id=\"4:64\" name=\"Balance\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"55\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:65\" name=\"Dana Utama: Rp2.125.000 · ▲ Rp206.920 (10,79%) Dana Saya (top up): Rp2.125.000\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"38\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:66\" name=\"Trending Hari ini (price · change)\" x=\"444\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"125\">\n          <text id=\"4:67\" name=\"Trending Hari ini (price · change)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"224\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:68\" name=\"BRRI · 8.600 · +50 (+0,58%) (Logo_BRRI) ARB · 8.600 · +50 (+0,58%) (Logo_ARB) FSX · 8.600 · +50 (+0,58%) (Logo_FSX)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:69\" name=\"Watchlist Saya (company · price · change)\" x=\"888\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"182\">\n          <text id=\"4:70\" name=\"Watchlist Saya (company · price · change)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"287\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:71\" name=\"DHDI · PT Duatiga Pertama · 8.600 · +50 (+0,58%) (Logo_DHDI) AMRI · PT Atma Merapi · 2.421 · −121 (−4,76%) (Logo_AMRI) ODD · PT Okufo Dokuri · 5.300 · +31 (+0,59%) (Logo_ODD) PYQ · PT Pimnas Yosque · 3.867 · −71 (−1,80%) (Logo_PYQ) DAN · PT Danang Amin · 6.600 · −201 (−2,96%) (Logo_DAN)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"114\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:72\" name=\"Indices (Asia)\" x=\"0\" y=\"206\" width=\"420\" height=\"125\">\n          <text id=\"4:73\" name=\"Indices (Asia)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"95\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:74\" name=\"IHSG · 7.206,92 · rising NIKKEI · 27.105,20 · falling SENSEX · 59.959,85 · rising\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:75\" name=\"Trending · 24 jam (company · price · change)\" x=\"444\" y=\"206\" width=\"420\" height=\"277\">\n          <text id=\"4:76\" name=\"Trending · 24 jam (company · price · change)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"304\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:77\" name=\"ROTI · Nippon Indosari Tbk · 8.600 · +50 (+0,58%) (Logo_ROTI) GOTO · GoTo Gojek Tokopedia · 189 · −9 (−4,55%) (Logo_GOTO) ABNB · Airbnb Inc · 5.300 · +31 (+0,59%) (Logo_ABNB) UNVR · Unilever Indonesia · 3.867 · −71 (−1,80%) (Logo_UNVR) BBRI · Bank Rakyat Indonesia · 4.630 · +38 (+0,83%) (Logo_BBRI) ADRO · Adaro Energy Indonesia · 3.600 · +21 (+0,59%) (Logo_ADRO)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"209\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:78\" name=\"Rekomendasi (company · price · change)\" x=\"888\" y=\"206\" width=\"420\" height=\"144\">\n          <text id=\"4:79\" name=\"Rekomendasi (company · price · change)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"278\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:80\" name=\"NFLX · Netflix, Inc · 2.122.340 · −0,20% META · Meta Platforms · 987.890 · +1,29% AMZN · Amazon.com, Inc · 1.001.333 · −6,20% (ticker badges are text — no logos)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"76\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:81\" name=\"GOTO · 1D chart\" x=\"0\" y=\"507\" width=\"420\" height=\"144\">\n          <text id=\"4:82\" name=\"GOTO · 1D chart\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"109\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:83\" name=\"Price at 6:00 197 · 10:00 199 · 14:00 194 · 18:00 196 · 22:00 192 · 2:00 189 Tooltip on the 22:00 point: Rp192 · 28 Okt 2022 - 22:00 · Volume: 102K\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"76\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:84\" name=\"Dibandingkan dengan (price · change)\" x=\"444\" y=\"507\" width=\"420\" height=\"125\">\n          <text id=\"4:85\" name=\"Dibandingkan dengan (price · change)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"262\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:86\" name=\"Bukalapak Tbk · BUKA · Rp276 · +2,82% Bank Rakyat Indonesia · BBRI · Rp4.630 · +0,83% PT Industri Jamu · SIDO · Rp740 · +2,82%\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:87\" name=\"Keystats (GOTO)\" x=\"888\" y=\"507\" width=\"420\" height=\"220\">\n          <text id=\"4:88\" name=\"Keystats (GOTO)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"116\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:89\" name=\"Previous Close · Rp198 Day Range · Rp188 - Rp199 Year Range · Rp180 - Rp396 Market Cap · 694,70T IDR AVG Volume · 167,58M P/E Ratio · 15,50 Dividend Yield · 3,76% Primary Exchange · IDX\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"152\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:90\" name=\"Pembayaran\" x=\"0\" y=\"751\" width=\"420\" height=\"125\">\n          <text id=\"4:91\" name=\"Pembayaran\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"86\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:92\" name=\"No Transaksi · FD8U4J38J004093J8U80TJ039 Nominal · Rp500.000 Kode Pembayaran · 1111000065665144\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:93\" name=\"Panduan Pembayaran (6 steps)\" x=\"444\" y=\"751\" width=\"420\" height=\"315\">\n          <text id=\"4:94\" name=\"Panduan Pembayaran (6 steps)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"215\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:95\" name=\"1. Catat kode pembayaran di atas dan datang ke gerai Alfamart, Alfa Midi, Lawson atau DAN+DAN terdekat. 2. Beritahukan ke kasir bahwa Anda ingin melakukan pembayaran. 3. Kasir akan menanyakan kode pembayaran. Berikan kode pembayaran Anda 1111000065665144. 4. Kasir akan melakukan konfirmasi data konsumen berupa Nama Merchant, Nama Konsumen, dan Nominal. Lakukan pembayaran ke kasir sejumlah nominal yang disebutkan. 5. Terima struk sebagai bukti pembayaran sudah sukses dilakukan. Notifikasi pembayaran akan langsung diterima oleh Merchant. 6. Selesai.\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"247\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:96\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"64\" y=\"3386\" width=\"1312\" height=\"312\">\n      <text id=\"4:97\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"328\" height=\"35\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:98\" name=\"Fixed vs yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"261\">\n        <frame id=\"4:99\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"221\">\n          <text id=\"4:100\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"103\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"4:101\" name=\"• Frame list and exact names • Must-include content per frame (what, not how) • Navigation structure and links • All data and copy (Bahasa Indonesia) • Brand primary #279646, Roboto, dark mode • Media: company logos, ticker marks, icons • Default Button, default Text Field, platform shell\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"140\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:102\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"261\">\n          <text id=\"4:103\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"197\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"4:104\" name=\"• Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen • All other colors: background / surface levels, neutrals, text, gain / loss, selected, warning, error / disabled, chart • Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation • All states: current tab, selected tab / chip / range / amount, rising / falling, current step, pressed, disabled • Headers, tab bar, tabs, chips, cards, rows, chart, key-stats table, stepper, payment details • Chart styling and tooltip\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"180\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:105\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"64\" y=\"3746\" width=\"1312\" height=\"281\">\n      <text id=\"4:106\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"222\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:107\" name=\"Your file is compared with this brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any original.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <text id=\"4:108\" name=\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data &amp; copy accuracy 3. Flow &amp; prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality &amp; consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (current tab, selected tab / chip / range / amount, current step, rising / falling, empty field)\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"154\" />\n      <text id=\"4:109\" name=\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 6 named frames, your components and the prototype.\" x=\"0\" y=\"259\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"941e9e8f-9f13-404f-85a0-b0b25ea4fd23","uuid":"fad1ee49-84a0-4926-b824-510dd98957c0","timestamp":"2026-10-31T22:14:50.768Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"4:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"4091\">\n    <frame id=\"4:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"170\">\n      <text id=\"4:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"19\" />\n      <text id=\"4:5\" name=\"Stock Trading — Indonesian stock investing app\" x=\"0\" y=\"31\" width=\"1312\" height=\"52\" />\n      <text id=\"4:6\" name=\"Design an Indonesian stock investing app (Bahasa Indonesia, dark mode): see your main balance, today’s trending tickers and your watchlist, browse global trending stocks, open the GOTO stock detail, and top up your balance at Alfamart up to the payment code. Canvas 375 × 812, dark mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"95\" width=\"1312\" height=\"75\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"282\" width=\"1312\" height=\"249\">\n      <text id=\"4:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 6 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand primary color, the typeface and dark mode in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (dark background and surface levels, neutrals, text, gain / loss, selected, warning, error / disabled, chart colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the tab bar, tabs and chips, and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the company logos, ticker marks and icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly (Indonesian number format: Rp2.125.000 · 0,58%). This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"198\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"579\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1325\">\n      <text id=\"4:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1236\">\n        <frame id=\"4:14\" name=\"01_Aktivitas\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"396\">\n          <text id=\"4:15\" name=\"01_Aktivitas\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"109\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:16\" name=\"Goal: See my balance, today’s trending tickers and my watchlist.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:18\" name=\"• Actions: Deposit (Icon_Deposit) · Tarik (Icon_Withdraw) • Balance: “Dana Utama” · Rp2.125.000 · rising Rp206.920 (10,79%) • Header: “Aktivitas” · menu (Icon_Menu) · settings (Icon_Settings) • Main navigation: tab bar Aktivitas / Trending / Top Up / Pasar / Profil · current: Aktivitas • Trending today: “Trending Hari ini” · BRRI · ARB · FSX, each with mark, ticker, price and change (see DATA) • Watchlist: “Watchlist Saya” · add (Icon_Plus) · DHDI · AMRI · ODD · PYQ · DAN, each with mark, ticker, company, price and change (see DATA)\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"160\" />\n          <text id=\"4:19\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"286\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:20\" name=\"→ Deposit → 04_Top_Up_Metode → Trending tab → 02_Trending → Top Up tab → 04_Top_Up_Metode\" x=\"24\" y=\"312\" width=\"596\" height=\"60\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:21\" name=\"02_Trending\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"436\">\n          <text id=\"4:22\" name=\"02_Trending\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"111\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:23\" name=\"Goal: Browse what is trending in global and regional markets.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:24\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:25\" name=\"• Header: “Trending” · menu (Icon_Menu) · settings (Icon_Settings) • Indices: IHSG · NIKKEI · SENSEX, each with value and direction (see DATA) • Main navigation: tab bar · current: Trending • Market tabs: Global · Crypto · Reksadana · CFD · current: Global • Recommendations: “Rekomendasi” · NFLX · META · AMZN, each with ticker, company, price and change (see DATA) • Regions: Asia · Eropa · Amerika · Mata Uang · current: Asia • Trending list: “Trending” · period “24 jam” (Icon_Chevron_Down) · ROTI · GOTO · ABNB · UNVR · BBRI · ADRO, each with logo, ticker, company, price and change (see DATA) · “Lihat Semua” (Icon_Chevron_Right)\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"200\" />\n          <text id=\"4:26\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"326\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:27\" name=\"→ GOTO → 03_Detail_Saham → Aktivitas tab → 01_Aktivitas → Top Up tab → 04_Top_Up_Metode\" x=\"24\" y=\"352\" width=\"596\" height=\"60\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:28\" name=\"03_Detail_Saham\" x=\"0\" y=\"460\" width=\"644\" height=\"376\">\n          <text id=\"4:29\" name=\"03_Detail_Saham\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"154\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:30\" name=\"Goal: Understand how GOTO is doing before buying or selling.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:31\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:32\" name=\"• Actions: Beli · Jual • Chart: 1D price line with a highlighted point and tooltip, time axis 6:00 – 2:00 (see DATA) • Compare: “Dibandingkan dengan” · BUKA · BBRI · SIDO, each with company, ticker, price and change (see DATA) • Header: back (Icon_Back) · add (Icon_Plus) · share (Icon_Share) · favorite (Icon_Star) • Key stats: “Keystats” · 8 rows (see DATA) • Range tabs: 1D · 5D · 1M · 6M · YTD · 1Y · 5Y · MAX · current: 1D • Stock: Logo_GOTO · GOTO · GoTo Gojek Tokopedia · Rp189 · falling −Rp9 (−4,55%) · “Hari ini”\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"180\" />\n          <text id=\"4:33\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"306\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:34\" name=\"→ back → 02_Trending\" x=\"24\" y=\"332\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:35\" name=\"04_Top_Up_Metode\" x=\"668\" y=\"460\" width=\"644\" height=\"336\">\n          <text id=\"4:36\" name=\"04_Top_Up_Metode\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"174\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:37\" name=\"Goal: Choose how to top up my balance.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:38\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:39\" name=\"• Balance: “Dana Saya” · Rp2.125.000 • Header: “Top Up” · back (Icon_Back) · help (Icon_Help) • Main navigation: tab bar · current: Top Up • Methods: “Pilih Metode” · ATM (Icon_ATM) · Kartu Debit (Icon_Debit_Card) · Mobile Banking (Icon_Mobile_Banking) · Indomaret (Icon_Store) · Alfamart (Icon_Store), each opens its next step (Icon_Chevron_Right)\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"120\" />\n          <text id=\"4:40\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"246\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:41\" name=\"→ Alfamart → 05_Top_Up_Nominal → back → 01_Aktivitas\" x=\"24\" y=\"272\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:42\" name=\"05_Top_Up_Nominal\" x=\"0\" y=\"860\" width=\"644\" height=\"376\">\n          <text id=\"4:43\" name=\"05_Top_Up_Nominal\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"178\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:44\" name=\"Goal: Pick the top-up amount for Alfamart.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:45\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:46\" name=\"• Action: Bayar • Amount options: “Pilih Nominal Top Up” · Rp50.000 · Rp100.000 · Rp200.000 · Rp300.000 · Rp500.000 · Rp1.000.000 · selected: Rp500.000 • Custom amount: “Atau masukkan nominal di sini” · field “Minimal Rp10.000” — empty • Header: “Top Up” · back (Icon_Back) · help (Icon_Help) • Main navigation: tab bar · current: Top Up • Method: “Top Up ke” · Alfamart (Icon_Store) · “Ganti” • Steps: 1 Masukkan Nominal · 2 Pembayaran · current: step 1\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"160\" />\n          <text id=\"4:47\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"286\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:48\" name=\"→ Bayar → 06_Top_Up_Pembayaran → back / Ganti → 04_Top_Up_Metode\" x=\"24\" y=\"312\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:49\" name=\"06_Top_Up_Pembayaran\" x=\"668\" y=\"860\" width=\"644\" height=\"316\">\n          <text id=\"4:50\" name=\"06_Top_Up_Pembayaran\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"215\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:51\" name=\"Goal: Know exactly how and by when to pay at the store.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:52\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:53\" name=\"• Action: Oke • Deadline: “Bayar Sebelum” · Minggu, 30 Oktober 2022, 13:32 WIB · countdown 00 : 08 : 46 • Guide: “Panduan Pembayaran” · 6 steps (see DATA) • Payment: No Transaksi · Nominal · Kode Pembayaran with copy (Icon_Copy) (see DATA) • Title: “Selesaikan Pembayaran” · “Silakan selesaikan proses pembayaran”\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"120\" />\n          <text id=\"4:54\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"246\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:55\" name=\"→ Oke → 01_Aktivitas\" x=\"24\" y=\"272\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:56\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"64\" y=\"1952\" width=\"1312\" height=\"183\">\n      <text id=\"4:57\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"242\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:58\" name=\"• Bottom tab bar with 5 tabs in this order: Aktivitas (Icon_Tab_Aktivitas), Trending (Icon_Tab_Trending), Top Up (Icon_Plus), Pasar (Icon_Tab_Pasar), Profil (Icon_Tab_Profil). Current tab: Aktivitas on 01, Trending on 02, Top Up on 04 and 05. 03 and 06 have no tab bar. How the current tab looks is yours. • Browse flow: 01_Aktivitas → 02_Trending → 03_Detail_Saham (GOTO). • Top-up flow: 01_Aktivitas (Deposit or Top Up tab) → 04_Top_Up_Metode → 05_Top_Up_Nominal (Alfamart) → 06_Top_Up_Pembayaran → Oke → 01_Aktivitas. • Entry only (no frame): menu, settings, Tarik, watchlist add, other tickers, Crypto / Reksadana / CFD, Eropa / Amerika / Mata Uang, 24 jam, Lihat Semua, Rekomendasi cards, range tabs other than 1D, add / share / favorite, Jual, Beli, compare items, ATM / Kartu Debit / Mobile Banking / Indomaret, help, copy code, Pasar, Profil.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"132\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:59\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"64\" y=\"2183\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1155\">\n      <text id=\"4:60\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"207\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:61\" name=\"Use these values verbatim. Bahasa Indonesia; prices in rupiah; Indonesian number format (“.” thousands, “,” decimals).\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:62\" name=\"Data blocks\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1066\">\n        <frame id=\"4:63\" name=\"Balance\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"106\">\n          <text id=\"4:64\" name=\"Balance\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"55\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:65\" name=\"Dana Utama: Rp